@startuml
title 客户内网License Server授权流程

participant "许可服务器\n(rlm + ISV server)" as Server
participant "客户端\n(集成RLM client)" as Client

Client -> Client: 启动产品
Client -> Client: rlm_init()\n定位license server
Client -> Server: rlm_checkout(product, version)

Server -> Server: 校验license文件签名
Server -> Server: 校验产品、版本、有效期
Server -> Server: 校验并发数量或授权规则
Server --> Client: 返回授权成功
Client -> Client: 进入可用状态
opt 使用结束
Client -> Server: rlm_checkin()
Server -> Server: 归还并发许可\n或更新使用状态
end
@enduml